# Source: https://github.com/wellmanifest/lifecycle
# Revision: 4b5e131a670afb46ca87291479fed7c0fefcf370
# Compatibility projection; domain conformance remains authoritative.

LIFECYCLE saas-tenant VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Commercial tenant state with verified billing and provisioning boundaries"
STATE REQUESTED INITIAL
STATE MEMBERSHIP_VERIFIED
STATE TRIAL_ACTIVE
STATE TRIAL_EXPIRING
STATE PAYMENT_PENDING
STATE PAID_PENDING_PROVISIONING
STATE ACTIVE
STATE PLAN_CHANGE_PENDING
STATE SUSPENDED
STATE CANCELLED TERMINAL
STATE EXPIRED TERMINAL
STATE FAILED TERMINAL
EVENT SIGNUP
EVENT START_TRIAL
EVENT TRIAL_NOTICE
EVENT SELECT_PLAN
EVENT CONFIRM_SUBSCRIPTION
EVENT PROVISION
EVENT PURCHASE_ADDON
EVENT REQUEST_PLAN_CHANGE
EVENT ACTIVATE_PLAN_CHANGE
EVENT SUSPEND
EVENT RESUME
EVENT CANCEL
EVENT EXPIRE
EVENT FAIL
EVIDENCE MEMBERSHIP_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE TRIAL_POLICY
EVIDENCE NOTICE_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE PLAN_SELECTION
EVIDENCE VERIFIED_BILLING
EVIDENCE VERIFIED_DEPLOYMENT
EVIDENCE VERIFIED_USAGE_GRANT
EVIDENCE PLAN_CHANGE_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE SUSPENSION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE CANCELLATION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE FAILURE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION REQUESTED -> MEMBERSHIP_VERIFIED ON SIGNUP REQUIRES MEMBERSHIP_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION MEMBERSHIP_VERIFIED -> TRIAL_ACTIVE ON START_TRIAL REQUIRES TRIAL_POLICY
TRANSITION MEMBERSHIP_VERIFIED -> PAYMENT_PENDING ON SELECT_PLAN REQUIRES PLAN_SELECTION
TRANSITION TRIAL_ACTIVE -> TRIAL_EXPIRING ON TRIAL_NOTICE REQUIRES NOTICE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION TRIAL_EXPIRING -> PAYMENT_PENDING ON SELECT_PLAN REQUIRES PLAN_SELECTION
TRANSITION PAYMENT_PENDING -> PAID_PENDING_PROVISIONING ON CONFIRM_SUBSCRIPTION REQUIRES VERIFIED_BILLING
TRANSITION PAID_PENDING_PROVISIONING -> ACTIVE ON PROVISION REQUIRES VERIFIED_DEPLOYMENT
TRANSITION ACTIVE -> ACTIVE ON PURCHASE_ADDON REQUIRES VERIFIED_USAGE_GRANT
TRANSITION ACTIVE -> PLAN_CHANGE_PENDING ON REQUEST_PLAN_CHANGE REQUIRES PLAN_CHANGE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION PLAN_CHANGE_PENDING -> ACTIVE ON ACTIVATE_PLAN_CHANGE REQUIRES VERIFIED_DEPLOYMENT
TRANSITION ACTIVE -> SUSPENDED ON SUSPEND REQUIRES SUSPENSION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION SUSPENDED -> ACTIVE ON RESUME REQUIRES VERIFIED_BILLING
TRANSITION TRIAL_ACTIVE -> CANCELLED ON CANCEL REQUIRES CANCELLATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION ACTIVE -> CANCELLED ON CANCEL REQUIRES CANCELLATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION TRIAL_EXPIRING -> EXPIRED ON EXPIRE REQUIRES EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION SUSPENDED -> EXPIRED ON EXPIRE REQUIRES EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION PAID_PENDING_PROVISIONING -> FAILED ON FAIL REQUIRES FAILURE_EVIDENCE
END
